  '[]'::jsonb, '[{"role":"Studio","name":"TwentyOne06"}]'::jsonb, 'Uniq Office focused on creating a workspace that balances professionalism with warmth, integrating an industrial aesthetic with bold elements and refined
finishes. The goal was to enhance functionality while reinforcing the brand’s identity through material selection, furniture choices, and a thoughtfully planned
layout. Every design decision was guided by Uniq’s brand guidelines, ensuring a cohesive and recognizable space that reflects the company’s ethos.', 'The new interior design of Uniq Office was shaped entirely by Uniq’s brand identity, ensuring every element aligned with the company’s visual and functional standards. The approach focused on:

Establishing a workspace that merges industrial strength with a welcoming warmth.
Creating clear zoning between open workspaces, private offices, and break-out areas.
Incorporating high-end materials and ergonomic
solutions for optimal productivity. Using brand colors and finishes to reinforce identity and
consistency.',
  'Modular acoustic ceiling system, bright brand-colored columns, and sit-stand workstations with privacy screens.', 'Uniq Office focused on creating a workspace that balances professionalism with warmth, integrating an industrial aesthetic with bold elements and refined
finishes. The goal was to enhance functionality while reinforcing …', '["Uniq Office focused on creating a workspace that balances professionalism with warmth, integrating an industrial aesthetic with bold elements and refined\nfinishes. The goal was to enhance functionality while reinforcing the brand’s identity through material selection, furniture choices, and a thoughtfully planned\nlayout. Every design decision was guided by Uniq’s brand guidelines, ensuring a cohesive and recognizable space that reflects the company’s ethos.","The new interior design of Uniq Office was shaped entirely by Uniq’s brand identity, ensuring every element aligned with the company’s visual and functional standards. The approach focused on:\n\nEstablishing a workspace that merges industrial strength with a welcoming warmth.\nCreating clear zoning between open workspaces, private offices, and break-out areas.\nIncorporating high-end materials and ergonomic\nsolutions for optimal productivity. Using brand colors and finishes to reinforce identity and\nconsistency.","Modular acoustic ceiling system, bright brand-colored columns, and sit-stand workstations with privacy screens."]'::jsonb, '/projects/uniq-thumnail24-c2318b31.jpg', '["/projects/uniq-thumnail24-c2318b31.jpg"]'::jsonb,
  'short', '["interior-design"]'::jsonb, false, 13, true
);
INSERT INTO public.projects (
  id, slug, title, location, price, category, year, client, area, status, duration,
  typologies, scope, materials, finishes, credits, challenge, approach, outcome,
  excerpt, body, hero, gallery, span, services, featured, sort_order, published
) VALUES (
  'ebfef651-4dfd-4c07-a7f7-2dcd962d2fe6', 'reif-kushiyaki', 'Reif Japanese Kushiyaki', 'Dubai, UAE', '',
  'Hospitality', '2025', 'Reif Japanese Kushiyaki', '', 'Completed',
  '', '["F&B Design"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb, '[{"role":"Studio","name":"TwentyOne06"}]'::jsonb, 'Reif Kushiyaki is a restaurant we designed for Michelin-awarded Chef Reif Othman, bringing his unconventional take on Far-Eastern cuisine to life
through immersive interiors. As the first licensed, full-service location in the UAE, the space blends elevated design with playful storytelling, offering
an intimate and dynamic dining experience where guests are fully immersed in the energy of the open kitchen and bar.', 'The design is rooted in the idea of refined rebellion breaking traditional norms while preserving the authenticity of Japanese
craftsmanship.

Inspired by Chef Reif’s bold approach to flavor and his passion for Astroboy, the
interiors balance raw textures with contemporary elements, creating an ambiance that feels both elevated and
approachable.',
  'To reflect the chef’s avant-garde style, the space integrates unexpected design details - from Astro Boy inspired murals to matcha whisk pendant lights. The L shaped layout ensures a natural flow, allowing guests to engage with the culinary theatrics unfolding in the open
kitchen.

Every design element, from seating to lighting, is curated
to enhance the dining journey.', 'Reif Kushiyaki is a restaurant we designed for Michelin-awarded Chef Reif Othman, bringing his unconventional take on Far-Eastern cuisine to life
through immersive interiors. As the first licensed, full-service location …', '["Reif Kushiyaki is a restaurant we designed for Michelin-awarded Chef Reif Othman, bringing his unconventional take on Far-Eastern cuisine to life\nthrough immersive interiors. As the first licensed, full-service location in the UAE, the space blends elevated design with playful storytelling, offering\nan intimate and dynamic dining experience where guests are fully immersed in the energy of the open kitchen and bar.","The design is rooted in the idea of refined rebellion breaking traditional norms while preserving the authenticity of Japanese\ncraftsmanship.\n\nInspired by Chef Reif’s bold approach to flavor and his passion for Astroboy, the\ninteriors balance raw textures with contemporary elements, creating an ambiance that feels both elevated and\napproachable.","To reflect the chef’s avant-garde style, the space integrates unexpected design details - from Astro Boy inspired murals to matcha whisk pendant lights. The L shaped layout ensures a natural flow, allowing guests to engage with the culinary theatrics unfolding in the open\nkitchen.\n\nEvery design element, from seating to lighting, is curated\nto enhance the dining journey.","A defining feature of Reif Kushiyaki is the open-plan kitchen, framed by large windows that invite diners to witness the precision and artistry behind each dish. This transparency enhances the storytelling aspect of the restaurant, ensuring that food isn’t just served, it’s performed.","Matcha Whisk Pendant Lights - A playful nod to Japanese tea culture, adding warmth and character.","Astro Boy Mural - A pop of nostalgia that reflects Chef Reif’s playful personality.","The process of collaborating with TwentyOne06 began with them getting to know me personally and understanding where I''m coming from. They adapted to my expectations while adding their own unique design input. It was a challenge for TwentyOne06 because many restaurant designers tend to replicate designs, but they didn’t. Instead, they transformed the design into what it is today, which is commendable."]'::jsonb, '/projects/reif-kushiyaki-reif-kushiyaki-twentyone06-5-1-scaled-e18f8136.jpg', '["/projects/reif-kushiyaki-22-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-f125a23c.png","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-23-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-1b67be48.png","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-24-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-144334bb.png","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-25-1-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-e9634956.png","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-26-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-1e8be78c.png","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-281-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-beaa2915.png","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-16-rijsi2j9deff3xhjs84geh517524fov4523ead1i3c-2636b299.jpg","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-15-rijsi2j9deeunc59g5fzvdb0talx5svxjklk9eij1s-1f2a541c.jpg","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-14-c6a39a74.jpg","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-17-1-231d74fd.jpg","/projects/reif-kushiyaki-review-6-vmcykcj-1-970c3019.jpg"]'::jsonb,
  'wide', '["interior-design"]'::jsonb, false, 14, true
);
INSERT INTO public.projects (
  id, slug, title, location, price, category, year, client, area, status, duration,
  typologies, scope, materials, finishes, credits, challenge, approach, outcome,
  excerpt, body, hero, gallery, span, services, featured, sort_order, published
) VALUES (
  '6bb3b768-3693-4217-ae70-cbe8a63a6b80', 'hlk', 'Hoe Lee Kow', 'Dubai, UAE', '',
  'Hospitality', '2025', 'Hoe Lee Kow', '', 'Completed',
  '', '["Branding","F&B Design"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb, '[{"role":"Studio","name":"TwentyOne06"}]'::jsonb, 'Hoe Lee Kow is Chef Reif Othman''s bold and unconventional take on Korean BBQ. Designed by TwentyOne06, the space moves away from traditional Korean aesthetics to create a playful, elevated dining experience that reflects Chef Reif''s signature creativity and love for experimentation.', 'The space is vibrant, eclectic, and full of personality, balancing playfulness with sophistication. The mix of modern finishes and cultural references results in a dynamic atmosphere that feels distinctly Korean yet uniquely Reif Othman.

Bespoke decorative lighting, handcrafted signage, and theatrical Korean elements set the tone for an immersive dining experience.',
  'The process of collaborating with TwentyOne06 began with them getting to know me personally and understanding where I''m coming from. They adapted to my expectations while adding their own unique design input. It was a challenge for TwentyOne06 because many restaurant designers tend to replicate designs, but they didn’t. Instead, they transformed the design into what it is today, which is commendable.', 'Hoe Lee Kow is Chef Reif Othman''s bold and unconventional take on Korean BBQ. Designed by TwentyOne06, the space moves away from traditional Korean aesthetics to create a playful, elevated dining experience that reflects…', '["Hoe Lee Kow is Chef Reif Othman''s bold and unconventional take on Korean BBQ. Designed by TwentyOne06, the space moves away from traditional Korean aesthetics to create a playful, elevated dining experience that reflects Chef Reif''s signature creativity and love for experimentation.","The space is vibrant, eclectic, and full of personality, balancing playfulness with sophistication. The mix of modern finishes and cultural references results in a dynamic atmosphere that feels distinctly Korean yet uniquely Reif Othman.\n\nBespoke decorative lighting, handcrafted signage, and theatrical Korean elements set the tone for an immersive dining experience.","The process of collaborating with TwentyOne06 began with them getting to know me personally and understanding where I''m coming from. They adapted to my expectations while adding their own unique design input. It was a challenge for TwentyOne06 because many restaurant designers tend to replicate designs, but they didn’t. Instead, they transformed the design into what it is today, which is commendable."]'::jsonb, '/projects/hlk-hoe-lee-kow-by-twentyone06-2-scaled-f66f04e5.jpg', '["/projects/hlk-25-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-bf219489.png","/projects/hlk-311-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-7e68f111.png","/projects/hlk-30-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-892c51ab.png","/projects/hlk-281-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-beaa2915.png","/projects/hlk-26-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-1e8be78c.png","/projects/hlk-291-rijsi2j3iw9i5pswyrq0rdlwvg7g19sobdew7nu9s0-81bcba49.png","/projects/hlk-27-rijsi2j3iw9g422hj5urwo0wu2d0wolk20v40d6ry8-3501932e.png","/projects/hlk-hlk-1-rijsi3h3k8gpfjg6mqj2yywhsixhndyuh6qvrn03x4-b19ee47f.jpg","/projects/hlk-hlk-3-3245e1e8.jpg","/projects/hlk-hlk-4-99590b17.jpg","/projects/hlk-hlk-5jpg-37eceaa1.jpg","/projects/hlk-review-6-vmcykcj-1-970c3019.jpg"]'::jsonb,
  'tall', '["branding","interior-design"]'::jsonb, false, 15, true
);
INSERT INTO public.projects (
  id, slug, title, location, price, category, year, client, area, status, duration,
  typologies, scope, materials, finishes, credits, challenge, approach, outcome,
  excerpt, body, hero, gallery, span, services, featured, sort_order, published
) VALUES (
  '2e5877b4-d9e1-4350-ae6c-f5ba7256d283', 'voco-monaco', 'Voco Monaco', 'Dubai, UAE', '',
  'Hospitality', '2025', 'Voco Monaco', '', 'Completed',
  '', '["Hospitality Design"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb, '[{"role":"Studio","name":"TwentyOne06"}]'::jsonb, 'The VOCO™ Monaco Hotel refurbishment project in Dubai transforms the hotel into a vibrant destination, blending familiar comforts with unique elements. It offers a relaxed atmosphere for adult guests seeking vibrant social experiences and relaxation, following the brand philosophy of “Small Change, Big Impact.”', 'The VOCO™ Hotel Brand embodies an AllParty, Everyday spirit. Here, every moment is a celebration, and fun is seamlessly integrated into every experience, from check-in to check-out.',
  'VOCO™ Hotels provide a refreshing alternative for travelers in search of something unique. Guests can unwind and enjoy themselves in a relaxed atmosphere that combines familiar comforts with exciting elements, resulting in a stay that is both dependable and distinctive.', 'The VOCO™ Monaco Hotel refurbishment project in Dubai transforms the hotel into a vibrant destination, blending familiar comforts with unique elements. It offers a relaxed atmosphere for adult guests seeking vibrant soci…', '["The VOCO™ Monaco Hotel refurbishment project in Dubai transforms the hotel into a vibrant destination, blending familiar comforts with unique elements. It offers a relaxed atmosphere for adult guests seeking vibrant social experiences and relaxation, following the brand philosophy of “Small Change, Big Impact.”","The VOCO™ Hotel Brand embodies an AllParty, Everyday spirit. Here, every moment is a celebration, and fun is seamlessly integrated into every experience, from check-in to check-out.","VOCO™ Hotels provide a refreshing alternative for travelers in search of something unique. Guests can unwind and enjoy themselves in a relaxed atmosphere that combines familiar comforts with exciting elements, resulting in a stay that is both dependable and distinctive.","The VOCO™ (Party) Hotel Design embodies the Design Philosophy of \"Small Change, Big Impact,\" aligning with the brand pillars of VOCO™ Hotels. It aims to create a sleek and sophisticated atmosphere that offers adult guests a memorable and enjoyable experience, perfect for vibrant social interactions and relaxation.","By focusing on details throughout the design-such as color schemes, finishes, lighting, décor, and furnishings- the ambiance is elevated to a refined and upscale level.","Upon the arriving at VOCO™ (Party) Hotel, guests are welcomed by branded walls, signage, and artwork that creates a familiar atmosphere. to establish a vibrant and immersive experience, guest are greeted with welcome drinks presented in a quirky manner. The reception makes a bold statement with it''s hanging disco artwork and vibrant colors. to spark the party spirit and promise an unforgettable stay, guests are invited to a lively, playful, and energetic lobby lounge."]'::jsonb, '/projects/voco-monaco-voco-monaco-bvpwdvpu-04920f2d.png', '["/projects/voco-monaco-elixa-spa-images02-4f029cc9.png","/projects/voco-monaco-voco-monaco-images03-rijsi2j3iw9g422hj5urwo0wu2d0wolk20v40d6ry8-e7e0117d.png","/projects/voco-monaco-elixa-spa-images03-e7a21dc3.png","/projects/voco-monaco-voco-monaco-images10-84b3b380.jpg","/projects/voco-monaco-voco-monaco-images11-22f8c0d3.jpg","/projects/voco-monaco-voco-monaco-images10-scaled-rijsi2j9deff3xhjs84geh517524fov4523ead1i3c-cc0e0746.jpg","/projects/voco-monaco-elixa-spa-images22-0ab0e2ac.jpg"]'::jsonb,
  'short', '["interior-design"]'::jsonb, false, 16, true
);
INSERT INTO public.projects (
  id, slug, title, location, price, category, year, client, area, status, duration,
  typologies, scope, materials, finishes, credits, challenge, approach, outcome,
  excerpt, body, hero, gallery, span, services, featured, sort_order, published
) VALUES (
  'cccb5e8c-05a9-4705-ae48-b127b481b98f', 'nama-yoso', 'NAMA YOSO', 'Dubai, UAE', '',
  'Hospitality', '2025', 'NAMA YOSO', '', 'Completed',
  '', '["Branding","F&B Design"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb, '[{"role":"Studio","name":"TwentyOne06"}]'::jsonb, 'The core of Nama Yoso embodies the concept of “Raw Materials,” which significantly shaped its interior and branddesign direction. This project was designed and completed for the award-winning celebrity chef, Reif Othman.', 'The Entrance Design Drawing inspiration from the sea and water, the restaurant''s distinctive blue color, reminiscent of the ocean, symbolizes tranquility. The orange hue roots in raw salmon, while beige tones pay homage to traditional Japanese canvases and wall partitions. The brand pattern, resembling Damascus steel, epitomizes a traditional Japanese forging technique, creating a cohesive and meaningful narrative for Nama Yoso',
  'The Entrance Design Drawing inspiration from the sea and water, the restaurant''s distinctive blue color, reminiscent of the ocean, symbolizes tranquility. The orange hue roots in raw salmon, while beige tones pay homage to traditional Japanese canvases and wall partitions. The brand pattern, resembling Damascus steel, epitomizes a traditional Japanese forging technique, creating a cohesive and meaningful narrative for Nama Yoso.', 'The core of Nama Yoso embodies the concept of “Raw Materials,” which significantly shaped its interior and branddesign direction. This project was designed and completed for the award-winning celebrity chef, Reif Othman.', '["The core of Nama Yoso embodies the concept of “Raw Materials,” which significantly shaped its interior and branddesign direction. This project was designed and completed for the award-winning celebrity chef, Reif Othman.","The Entrance Design Drawing inspiration from the sea and water, the restaurant''s distinctive blue color, reminiscent of the ocean, symbolizes tranquility. The orange hue roots in raw salmon, while beige tones pay homage to traditional Japanese canvases and wall partitions. The brand pattern, resembling Damascus steel, epitomizes a traditional Japanese forging technique, creating a cohesive and meaningful narrative for Nama Yoso","The Entrance Design Drawing inspiration from the sea and water, the restaurant''s distinctive blue color, reminiscent of the ocean, symbolizes tranquility. The orange hue roots in raw salmon, while beige tones pay homage to traditional Japanese canvases and wall partitions. The brand pattern, resembling Damascus steel, epitomizes a traditional Japanese forging technique, creating a cohesive and meaningful narrative for Nama Yoso.","The Entrance Design Drawing inspiration from the sea and water, the restaurant''s distinctive blue color, reminiscent of the ocean, symbolizes tranquility. The orange hue roots in raw salmon, while beige tones pay homage to traditional Japanese canvases and wall partitions. The brand pattern, resembling Damascus steel, epitomizes a traditional Japanese forging technique, creating a cohesive and meaningful narrative for Nama Yoso.","Zen Garden feature - Artistic stone and sand artwork","The process of collaborating with TwentyOne06 began with them getting to know me personally and understanding where I''m coming from. They adapted to my expectations while adding their own unique design input. It was a challenge for TwentyOne06 because many restaurant designers tend to replicate designs, but they didn’t. Instead, they transformed the design into what it is today, which is commendable."]'::jsonb, '/projects/nama-yoso-nama20yoso-87ssgdhd1-dcb367d5.png', '["/projects/nama-yoso-cid-awards-hospitality-ynlmoslg-rijsi0nf586xihvn9qwrme2zoogplvl7n43x93x24g-cf34fba7.png","/projects/nama-yoso-cid-mena-highly-commended-c1-8fbsb-rijsi0nf586vgu57u51irohznamahae3drk51t9kao-adc10239.png","/projects/nama-yoso-food-in-space-3-dpdsg2dk-rijsi0nf586vgu57u51irohznamahae3drk51t9kao-8765da4b.png","/projects/nama-yoso-int-design-awards-d0gza-ym-rijsi0nf586vgu57u51irohznamahae3drk51t9kao-d81cd18f.png","/projects/nama-yoso-liv-hospitality-awards-2-byyttlmm-copy-1-rijsi0nf586vgu57u51irohznamahae3drk51t9-63af04b7.png","/projects/nama-yoso-love-that-design-ntuecka1-rijsi0nf586vgu57u51irohznamahae3drk51t9kao-e7d0cc56.png","/projects/nama-yoso-luxury-lifestyle-awards-bvm3c-tm-rijsi0nf586vgu57u51irohznamahae3drk51t9kao-8d30a41c.png","/projects/nama-yoso-restaurant-and-bar-design-awards-wrohjhsa-1-rijsi1l9c285sg3uong5c69g8ohnozhtpw7m-30a821c1.png","/projects/nama-yoso-designdetails11-hsk4sbq5-fc08d621.png","/projects/nama-yoso-designdetails7-20y3fyat-801af4b8.png","/projects/nama-yoso-designdetails7-20y3fyat-rijsi0nkzqcugpka37b79hm40dbe0anngssfbt4afs-25b46e40.png","/projects/nama-yoso-designdetails12-bqesuush-256c3b4e.png"]'::jsonb,
  'wide', '["branding","interior-design"]'::jsonb, false, 17, true
);
INSERT INTO public.projects (
  id, slug, title, location, price, category, year, client, area, status, duration,
  typologies, scope, materials, finishes, credits, challenge, approach, outcome,
  excerpt, body, hero, gallery, span, services, featured, sort_order, published
) VALUES (
  'cf37e548-bc40-441b-a717-3316ba7f0db5', 'pitfire', 'PITFIRE PIZZA BAKERS', 'Dubai, UAE', '',
  'Hospitality', '2025', 'PITFIRE PIZZA BAKERS', '', 'Completed',
  '', '["F&B Design"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb, '[{"role":"Studio","name":"TwentyOne06"}]'::jsonb, 'TwentyOne06 revitalizes Pitfire Pizza''s decade-long brand with a design narrative inspired by the ''religion of baking, ''ushering in raw and rustic elements to its first licensed venue in Dubai.', 'Slim and minimalistic furniture, adorned in brand colors, complements the space. Low freestanding walls and waiting bench seating, crafted with rustic wood framing and black leather upholstery, add to the ambiance.',
  'Original Pitfire signage art adds a nostalgic touch, further enriching the space''s cultural tapestry. Art takes center stage in the design narrative, echoing Pitfire''s collaboration with local artists. Portraits of iconic figures such as ''The Grateful Dead'' adorn the walls, as well as a wall full of vibrant poster art encapsulating the brand’s love of creating visuals, creating Instagram-worthy moments that pay homage to the brand''s counter-cultural roots.', 'TwentyOne06 revitalizes Pitfire Pizza''s decade-long brand with a design narrative inspired by the ''religion of baking, ''ushering in raw and rustic elements to its first licensed venue in Dubai.', '["TwentyOne06 revitalizes Pitfire Pizza''s decade-long brand with a design narrative inspired by the ''religion of baking, ''ushering in raw and rustic elements to its first licensed venue in Dubai.","Slim and minimalistic furniture, adorned in brand colors, complements the space. Low freestanding walls and waiting bench seating, crafted with rustic wood framing and black leather upholstery, add to the ambiance.","Original Pitfire signage art adds a nostalgic touch, further enriching the space''s cultural tapestry. Art takes center stage in the design narrative, echoing Pitfire''s collaboration with local artists. Portraits of iconic figures such as ''The Grateful Dead'' adorn the walls, as well as a wall full of vibrant poster art encapsulating the brand’s love of creating visuals, creating Instagram-worthy moments that pay homage to the brand''s counter-cultural roots."]'::jsonb, '/projects/pitfire-blog-post-image-9-42582a88.jpg', '["/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza07-rijsi1l9c28bxfb4zh1vwb0gcu0x2r36hxuz4z6nls-6487b9c6.png","/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza08-rijsi1l9c287u3ua49be6vuga2c2tkoxz8reqdvny8-9843d08d.png","/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza09-rijsi1l9c287u3ua49be6vuga2c2tkoxz8reqdvny8-bf6b070e.png","/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza20-f7c754c0.png","/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza21-ec9be74c.png","/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza23-6dd97371.webp","/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza24-7db96745.png","/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza25-1ab5d39f.png","/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza26-76c12acb.png","/projects/pitfire-pit-fire-pizza30-c063369f.jpg"]'::jsonb,
  'tall', '["interior-design"]'::jsonb, false, 18, true
);
INSERT INTO public.projects (
  id, slug, title, location, price, category, year, client, area, status, duration,
  typologies, scope, materials, finishes, credits, challenge, approach, outcome,
  excerpt, body, hero, gallery, span, services, featured, sort_order, published
) VALUES (
  '8fd45b13-6f5d-4973-a845-5ba052b54371', 'tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman', 'TERO - THE CHEF''S TABLE', 'Dubai, UAE', '',
  'Hospitality', '2025', 'TERO - THE CHEF''S TABLE', '', 'Completed',
  '', '["Branding","F&B Design"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb, '[{"role":"Studio","name":"TwentyOne06"}]'::jsonb, 'Crafted for Reif Othman, TERO (The Experience) is not just a Chef''s Table; it''s an immersive journey through theenchanting lounge, culminating in the exclusive 12-seater sanctuary where culinary artistry takes center stage.', 'Wooden table forms a U-shape, paired with custom chairs, in front of a preparation counter and open show kitchen, allowing diners a front-row seat at the chef’s cooking station.',
  'The process of collaborating with TwentyOne06 began with them getting to know me personally and understanding where I''m coming from. They adapted to my expectations while adding their own unique design input. It was a challenge for TwentyOne06 because many restaurant designers tend to replicate designs, but they didn’t. Instead, they transformed the design into what it is today, which is commendable.', 'Crafted for Reif Othman, TERO (The Experience) is not just a Chef''s Table; it''s an immersive journey through theenchanting lounge, culminating in the exclusive 12-seater sanctuary where culinary artistry takes center sta…', '["Crafted for Reif Othman, TERO (The Experience) is not just a Chef''s Table; it''s an immersive journey through theenchanting lounge, culminating in the exclusive 12-seater sanctuary where culinary artistry takes center stage.","Wooden table forms a U-shape, paired with custom chairs, in front of a preparation counter and open show kitchen, allowing diners a front-row seat at the chef’s cooking station.","The process of collaborating with TwentyOne06 began with them getting to know me personally and understanding where I''m coming from. They adapted to my expectations while adding their own unique design input. It was a challenge for TwentyOne06 because many restaurant designers tend to replicate designs, but they didn’t. Instead, they transformed the design into what it is today, which is commendable."]'::jsonb, '/projects/tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman-tero-dqjof2zh-2-d093099f.png', '["/projects/tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman-tero-images02-rijsi1l9c287u3ua49be6vuga2c2tkoxz8reqdvny8-0d7af521.png","/projects/tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman-tero-images03-rijsi1l9c285sg3uong5c69g8ohnozhtpw7mj3864g-8a1c356b.png","/projects/tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman-tero-images04-rijsi1l9c285sg3uong5c69g8ohnozhtpw7mj3864g-e73a28fd.png","/projects/tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman-tero-images05-rijsi1l9c285sg3uong5c69g8ohnozhtpw7mj3864g-2fc49fff.png","/projects/tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman-tero-images06-rijsi1l9c285sg3uong5c69g8ohnozhtpw7mj3864g-4fbe409b.png","/projects/tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman-tero-images15-a2575a14.jpg","/projects/tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman-tero-images15-scaled-rijsi1lf6ke4sbiwxppttzdklr6r7zrdsxfwt32w9k-e6120242.jpg","/projects/tero-the-experience-by-reif-othman-review-6-vmcykcj-1-970c3019.jpg"]'::jsonb,
  'short', '["branding","interior-design"]'::jsonb, false, 19, true
);
INSERT INTO public.projects (
  id, slug, title, location, price, category, year, client, area, status, duration,
  typologies, scope, materials, finishes, credits, challenge, approach, outcome,
  excerpt, body, hero, gallery, span, services, featured, sort_order, published
) VALUES (
  'bb0f1716-9c4b-4d0a-a06d-b9fdf668e1a5', 'elix', 'ELIX SPA', 'Dubai, UAE', '',
  'Hospitality', '2025', 'ELIX SPA', '', 'Completed',
  '', '["Branding","Hospitality Design"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb,
  '[]'::jsonb, '[{"role":"Studio","name":"TwentyOne06"}]'::jsonb, 'Elix Spa is a hotel refurbishment project of the St. Tropez Hotel located in the Heart of Europe on Dubai Islands. This unique "party spa" aims to revitalize hotel guests and "bring them back to life" by balancing vibrancy with harmony.', 'ELIX is establishing itself as a unique “party spa” dedicated to revitalizing hotel guests and “bringing them back to life.” With this vision, our concept focuses on developing a brand that embodies both vibrancy and harmony',
  'Additionally, we are drawing inspiration from the ancient belief that elixirs could transform base metals into gold. This idea influences our visual branding, incorporating golden and brass accents into our brand materials and interior designs.', 'Elix Spa is a hotel refurbishment project of the St. Tropez Hotel located in the Heart of Europe on Dubai Islands. This unique "party spa" aims to revitalize hotel guests and "bring them back to life" by balancing vibran…', '["Elix Spa is a hotel refurbishment project of the St. Tropez Hotel located in the Heart of Europe on Dubai Islands. This unique \"party spa\" aims to revitalize hotel guests and \"bring them back to life\" by balancing vibrancy with harmony.","ELIX is establishing itself as a unique “party spa” dedicated to revitalizing hotel guests and “bringing them back to life.” With this vision, our concept focuses on developing a brand that embodies both vibrancy and harmony","Additionally, we are drawing inspiration from the ancient belief that elixirs could transform base metals into gold. This idea influences our visual branding, incorporating golden and brass accents into our brand materials and interior designs.","The Entrance Design Drawing inspiration from the sea and water, the restaurant''s distinctive blue color, reminiscent of the ocean, symbolizes tranquility. The orange hue roots in raw salmon, while beige tones pay homage to traditional Japanese canvases and wall partitions. The brand pattern, resembling Damascus steel, epitomizes a traditional Japanese forging technique, creating a cohesive and meaningful narrative for Nama Yoso.","Senior Design Manager\nKleindienst Group (Voco Monaco, Elix Spa)"]'::jsonb, '/projects/elix-elixa-spa-images01-fd9e7dee.jpg', '["/projects/elix-elixa-spa-images02-4f029cc9.png","/projects/elix-elixa-spa-images03-e7a21dc3.png","/projects/elix-elixa-spa-images12-2455f064.jpg","/projects/elix-elixa-spa-images13-b79f86d5.jpg","/projects/elix-elixa-spa-images12-rijsi1lf6ke4sbiwxppttzdklr6r7zrdsxfwt32w9k-40f7583d.jpg","/projects/elix-elixa-spa-images22-0ab0e2ac.jpg"]'::jsonb,
  'wide', '["branding","interior-design"]'::jsonb, false, 20, true
);
INSERT INTO public.services (
