      '3f0e5245-78b0-4f2c-af48-bad91855b738',
      'What industries does TwentyOne06 work with?',
      'We primarily work across hospitality, F&B, hotels, retail, and commercial sectors throughout Dubai, the UAE, and the wider GCC region. Our experience ranges from restaurants and cafés to luxury hotels, retail destinations, workplaces, and customer-focused environments where design plays a critical role in business success.',
      '<p>We primarily work across hospitality, F&amp;B, hotels, retail, and commercial sectors throughout Dubai, the UAE, and the wider GCC region. Our experience ranges from restaurants and cafés to luxury hotels, retail destinations, workplaces, and customer-focused environments where design plays a critical role in business success.</p>',
